<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Arvind Sylva is a New Launch project by Arvind in Mullur, Bangalore, spread across 4.69 Acres with 374 homes. Arvind Sylva Mullur offers 3, 4 BHK ranging from 1563 Sq.Ft. to 2293 Sq.Ft., priced from ₹ 1.95 Cr, with possession expected from Aug 2030. Marketed as "The Green Reserve," Arvind Sylva dedicates a large majority of its land to open spaces and landscaped greens, anchored by a 15,000+ sq. ft. clubhouse. It sits close to Sarjapur Road, keeping Bangalore's Sarjapur Road, Whitefield, and Electronic City corridors within reach. Arvind brings 26 delivered projects to this launch, and Mullur's average asking price runs well below Arvind Sylva's own rate, reflecting the project's positioning as a premium option in a still-developing locality.</p></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

		
      
