              <div class="why-consider-list" id="why-consider-list">
              <ul><li>Nature-Rich Community Featuring 70% Green Spaces and 1,000+ Flora Varieties.</li><li>Thoughtfully planned with biophilic design for everyday wellness.</li><li>15,000+ Sq. Ft. Grand Clubhouse with 40+ Premium Lifestyle Amenities.</li><li>Close to Embassy Tech Village, Brigade Software Park, and Wipro Sarjapur.</li><li>Excellent connectivity to Whitefield, Electronic City, and Outer Ring Road.</li><li>An ideal investment opportunity in Bangalore's rapidly growing Sarjapur Road corridor.</li></ul>
