 <section class="white-box about-project" id="about-project" aria-labelledby="about-project-heading">
          <span class="section-label">Overview</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="about-project-heading">About Arvind Sylva, Mullur by Arvind</h2>
          
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Arvind Sylva is a New Launch development in Mullur, Bangalore, built by Arvind across 4.69 Acres. The project comprises 4 towers offering 374 homes across 3, 4 BHK, with sizes running from 1563 Sq.Ft. to 2293 Sq.Ft.. Possession is scheduled from Aug 2030, and Arvind Sylva Mullur is registered under Karnataka RERA.</p><h3>Key Project Details</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Parameter</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Project Name</td><td>Arvind Sylva</td></tr><tr><td>Developer</td><td>Arvind</td></tr><tr><td>Location</td><td>Mullur, Bangalore</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>New Launch</td></tr><tr><td>Possession</td><td>Aug 2030</td></tr><tr><td>RERA Number</td><td>PRM/KA/RERA/1251/446/PR/090726/008800</td></tr><tr><td>Total Area</td><td>4.69 Acres</td></tr><tr><td>Total Towers</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Total Units</td><td>374</td></tr><tr><td>Configuration</td><td>3, 4 BHK</td></tr><tr><td>Size Range</td><td>1563 Sq.Ft. to 2293 Sq.Ft.</td></tr><tr><td>Starting Price</td><td>₹ 1.95 Cr</td></tr><tr><td>Connecting Roads</td><td>Sarjapur Road</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>What makes Arvind Sylva different from other projects?</h3><ul><li>Roughly 70 to 75% of the development is dedicated to open spaces and landscaped greens, with 1,000+ varieties of native flora across herbal and edible shrub gardens</li><li>A 15,000+ sq. ft. clubhouse with 40+ lifestyle amenities anchors the community</li><li>Four signature towers on a 4.69-acre plot, keeping density moderate relative to unit count</li><li>Sits on the Sarjapur Road corridor, one of Bangalore's fastest-growing residential belts, with access to ORR, Whitefield, and Electronic City</li></ul></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

      </section>



      
