              <h4 class="updates-list-heading">Experts Discuss &#39;Demagnetizing&#39; Bengaluru to Manage Growth and Traffic</h4>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">Experts at the India Today Karnataka Summit 2026 discussed strategies to manage Bengaluru&#39;s rapid growth, suggesting a need to &#39;demagnetize&#39; the city by decentralizing development to surrounding areas and promoting WFH. They highlighted that the city&#39;s infrastructure, particularly roads and public transport, is struggling to keep pace with population growth.</p>
