    <section class="white-box floor-plans-section" id="floor-plans" aria-labelledby="floor-plans-heading">
            <span class="section-label">Plans</span>
            <h2 class="section-title" id="floor-plans-heading">Arvind Sylva Floor Plans</h2>
            
                
                
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Arvind Sylva offers four unit variants across two configurations, 3, 4 BHK Flats, giving buyers a fairly focused choice set built around family-sized homes.</p><h3>Configuration and Pricing</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Unit Type</strong></th><th><strong>Saleable Area</strong></th><th><strong>Price</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3 BHK Apartment</td><td>1563 Sq. Ft.</td><td>₹ 1.95 Cr</td></tr><tr><td>3 BHK Apartment </td><td>1748 Sq. Ft. </td><td>₹ 2.19 Cr </td></tr><tr><td>3 BHK Apartment</td><td>1839 Sq. Ft.</td><td>₹ 2.30 Cr</td></tr><tr><td>4 BHK Apartment </td><td>2293 Sq. Ft. </td><td>₹ 2.87 Cr </td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>Which Arvind Sylva floor plan is right for a first-time buyer?</h3><p>The 3 BHK Apartment at 1563 Sq. Ft. for ₹ 1.95 Cr is the most accessible entry point into Arvind Sylva Mullur. It carries the same clubhouse and green-space access as the larger units, making it a reasonable way into the Sarjapur Road corridor without needing to stretch for the largest configuration.</p><h3>Which Arvind Sylva unit should a rental investor choose?</h3><p>The 3 BHK Apartment  at 1748 Sq. Ft.  for ₹ 2.19 Cr  balances size against price efficiently for an investor. Mullur's proximity to IT hubs like Wipro SEZ and RGA Tech Park supports steady rental interest from working professionals in the corridor.</p><h3>Who should consider the largest Arvind Sylva unit?</h3><p>The 4 BHK at 2293 Sq. Ft. for ₹ 2.87 Cr suits a buyer who wants maximum space in a nature-forward setting and plans to hold it long-term. With school options like Oakridge International School and Greenwood High nearby, it's a reasonable fit for families prioritizing both space and access to established international schools.</p><h3>What to verify before booking?</h3><ol><li>Confirm the RERA-filed carpet or saleable area distinction against the figure quoted for each unit</li><li>Check the construction-linked payment plan against the August 2030 possession date</li><li>Ask which of the four towers a specific unit sits in, and its distance from the clubhouse and main green zones</li><li>Verify current construction progress directly with the developer or via the RERA portal, given the multi-year timeline to possession</li></ol></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

            
