  <section id="amenities" class="white-box amenities-specifications" aria-labelledby="amenities-specs-heading">
        <span class="section-label">Amenities</span>
          <h2 id="amenities-specs-heading" class="section-title">Amenities &amp; Specifications of Arvind Sylva</h2>
          
          
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Arvind Sylva's amenities span sports, convenience, safety, leisure, and environment categories, anchored by the project's signature 15,000+ sq. ft. clubhouse and extensive landscaped greens.</p><h3>Sports &amp; Fitness</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Amenity</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gymnasium</td><td>Fitness</td></tr><tr><td>Badminton Court(s)</td><td>Racquet Sports</td></tr><tr><td>Table Tennis</td><td>Indoor Sport</td></tr><tr><td>Snooker / Pool / Billiards</td><td>Indoor Leisure</td></tr><tr><td>Skating Rink</td><td>Outdoor Sport</td></tr><tr><td>Yoga Areas</td><td>Wellness</td></tr><tr><td>Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits</td><td>Family</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>Convenience &amp; Safety</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Amenity</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Power Backup</td><td>Convenience</td></tr><tr><td>Treated Water Supply</td><td>Convenience</td></tr><tr><td>24x7 Water Supply</td><td>Convenience</td></tr><tr><td>Lift</td><td>Convenience</td></tr><tr><td>Party Lawn</td><td>Convenience</td></tr><tr><td>24x7 Security</td><td>Safety</td></tr><tr><td>CCTV / Video Surveillance</td><td>Safety</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>Leisure &amp; Environment</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Amenity</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Clubhouse</td><td>Leisure</td></tr><tr><td>Reading Room / Library</td><td>Leisure</td></tr><tr><td>Indoor Games</td><td>Leisure</td></tr><tr><td>Normal Park / Central Green</td><td>Environment</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Beyond this categorised list, the project's own amenity description also calls out EV charging stations, a herbal and edible shrub garden with 1,000+ native flora varieties, a grand entrance lobby, and dedicated multipurpose and social gathering spaces, additions that support the project's "Green Reserve" positioning.</p><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong>Key Takeaway:</strong> The combination of a skating rink, EV charging, and a genuinely large native-flora garden alongside the standard clubhouse mix gives Arvind Sylva Mullur a slightly more nature-and-family-oriented amenity profile than a typical Sarjapur Road launch at this price point.</p></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

          
          
