 <section class="white-box bx-no-space location-intelligence" id="location-intelligence" aria-labelledby="location-intelligence-heading">
        <span class="section-label">Location</span>
        <h2 id="location-intelligence-heading" class="section-title"> Location and Connectivity Around Arvind Mullur </h2>
        
        
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>The project offers seamless connectivity to major IT corridors, business parks, educational institutions, healthcare centres, and lifestyle destinations. With easy access to ORR, Whitefield, Electronic City, and the upcoming Metro network, residents can enjoy shorter commute times while staying close to everything required for a comfortable urban lifestyle.</p><p><strong></strong></p><h3>Commute &amp; Connectivity</h3><p><strong></strong></p><ul><li>Approximately 2 km from Sarjapur Main Road.</li><li>Around 5 km from Kodathi Gate Junction.</li><li>Easy access to Outer Ring Road (ORR) via Sarjapur Road.</li><li>Close to the upcoming Kodathi Metro Station (Blue Line).</li><li>Approximately 12 km from Whitefield.</li><li>Well-connected to Electronic City through the proposed Satellite Town Ring Road (STRR).</li><li>Approximately 18 km from KR Puram Railway Station.</li><li>Around 48 km from Kempegowda International Airport.</li></ul><h3>IT Parks and Business Hubs</h3><p><strong></strong></p><ul><li>Wipro SEZ, Kodathi -approximately 3 km.</li><li>RGA Tech Park -around 6 km.</li><li>RMZ Ecoworld -approximately 9 km.</li><li>Embassy TechVillage -around 10 km.</li><li>Prestige Tech Park -approximately 11 km.</li><li>Cessna Business Park -around 12 km.</li><li>Global Technology Park -approximately 12 km.</li><li>International Tech Park Bangalore (ITPL) around 14 km.</li><li>Bagmane Tech Park -approximately 17 km.</li></ul><p><strong></strong></p><h3>Schools and Educational Institutions</h3><p><strong></strong></p><ul><li>Delhi Public School, East.</li><li>Oakridge International School.</li><li>Greenwood High International School.</li><li>The International School Bangalore (TISB).</li><li>Indus International School.</li><li>Harvest International School.</li><li>Primus Public School.</li><li>National Public School, Sarjapur Road</li></ul><p><strong></strong></p><h3>Hospitals and Healthcare</h3><p><strong></strong></p><ul><li>Motherhood Hospital, Sarjapur Road.</li><li>Manipal Hospital, Sarjapur Road.</li><li>Columbia Asia Hospital.</li><li>Sakra World Hospital.</li><li>Cloudnine Hospital.</li><li>Narayana Multispeciality Hospital.</li></ul><p><strong></strong></p><h3>Shopping, Dining and Entertainment</h3><p><strong></strong></p><ul><li>Market Square Mall.</li><li>Forum Mall, Koramangala.</li><li>Nexus Whitefield.</li><li>Central Mall, Bellandur.</li><li>Virginia Mall, Whitefield.</li></ul></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

        
