 <section class="white-box frequently-asked-questions" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
          <span class="section-label">FAQs</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions About Arvind Sylva</h2>
          <div class="faq-box">
            
            <article class="faq-item active">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">Where exactly is Arvind Sylva located? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-1">
                <p>Arvind Sylva is in Mullur, Bangalore, within the East Bangalore belt. The location gives residents access to Sarjapur Road, keeping commutes to business districts and daily errands predictable without lengthy detours. Karunalayam Hospital, Carmelaram, Harvest International School, Kodathi, Iblur Park, Bellandur, Courtyard by Marriott, Bellandur are within reach, and the area carries a connectivity index of 4.1, a measurable indicator of how the location actually performs on a regular working day.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">What is the starting price of Arvind Sylva? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-2">
                <p>Arvind Sylva is priced from ₹ 1.95 Cr, with the upper range reaching ₹ 2.87 Cr depending on the configuration and floor selected. The entry point covers the smallest available unit, while larger 3, 4 BHK Flats are priced at higher levels. Unit sizes run from 1563 Sq.Ft. to 2293 Sq.Ft..</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3">Who is the developer of Arvind Sylva? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-3">
                <p>Arvind Sylva is developed by Arvind, a real estate company with 10 years in the industry and 26 projects completed across multiple cities. For buyers committing funds ahead of possession, a developer's execution track record carries more practical weight than marketing material. Arvind's delivery history and project scale give buyers a reasonable basis for evaluating construction quality and timeline credibility.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4">What configurations and unit sizes are available in Arvind Sylva? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-4">
                <p>Arvind Sylva offers 3, 4 BHK Flats with unit sizes ranging from 1563 Sq.Ft. to 2293 Sq.Ft.. This range covers compact layouts suited to individuals and couples as well as larger floor plans designed for families of four or more. Each configuration is planned with ventilation, natural light access and practical room separation in mind. Detailed 2D and 3D floor plans for every unit type are available in the floor plans section on this page.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5">Is Arvind Sylva RERA registered? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-5">
                <p>Yes. Arvind Sylva is registered under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act with RERA number PRM/KA/RERA/1251/446/PR/090726/008800. This registration places the project's construction timeline, fund utilisation and possession date on public record with the state RERA authority. Buyers can verify the status and track construction progress directly on the state RERA portal using this number.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-6">When is the possession date for Arvind Sylva? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-6">
                <p>Arvind Sylva is currently New Launch, with Aug 2030 registered as the possession date. This is a legally documented timeline filed with the state RERA authority under registration number PRM/KA/RERA/1251/446/PR/090726/008800, not an advisory estimate. Buyers paying in advance of completion can verify construction progress against the registered milestones on the RERA portal at any point before taking possession.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-7">What amenities are available at Arvind Sylva? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-7" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-7">
                <p>Arvind Sylva includes Gymnasium, Badminton Court(s), Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Reading Room/Library, Clubhouse, Normal Park / Central Green for regular resident use. The facilities are distributed across the development rather than concentrated in a single building, which keeps them accessible and practical during peak hours. Spaces cover multiple age groups and daily needs, from fitness and sports infrastructure to leisure zones and quieter areas for senior residents.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-8">How well connected is Arvind Sylva to the rest of Bangalore? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-8" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-8">
                <p>Arvind Sylva at Mullur Bangalore sits close to Sarjapur Road, which handles most commute routes to employment hubs and commercial areas in Bangalore. Karunalayam Hospital, Carmelaram, Harvest International School, Kodathi, Iblur Park, Bellandur, Courtyard by Marriott, Bellandur are within a reasonable distance, and the area holds a connectivity index of 4.1. For most residents, this score reflects what they confirm within the first few weeks of living here: daily movement is predictable without needing a detour or a workaround.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-9">What schools and banks are near Arvind Sylva? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-9" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-9">
                <p>St Patricks Academy, Sri Ravushankar Vidya Mandir, Carmel Convent High School, Sapthagiri School, Nava Jeevana Mahila Pragathi Kendra are close to Arvind Sylva, which makes the project practical for families managing school runs alongside work commutes. ICICI Bank, Hdfc Bank, Hdfc Bank, Chartered Sahakari Bank Niyamitha, Icici Bank are also nearby for routine financial needs, removing two of the more common location compromises families make when shortlisting areas. The locality's education and health index of 4.0 gives buyers a measurable read on the available social infrastructure before making a commitment.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-10" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-10">Is Arvind Sylva a good investment? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-10" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-10">
                <p>Arvind Sylva sits in Mullur, Bangalore, an area with a livability index of 3.7. The project is backed by Arvind's 10 years of delivery experience across 26 completed projects, which supports confidence in on-time possession. Combined with the East Bangalore's infrastructure trajectory and demand from working professionals and families, the project presents a credible medium to long-term investment case rather than a speculative one.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-11" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-11">How many homes are there in Arvind Sylva and how large is the project? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-11" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-11">
                <p>Arvind Sylva has 374 homes at Mullur Bangalore. Unit sizes run from 1563 Sq.Ft. to 2293 Sq.Ft. across 3, 4 BHK Flats. The scale of the development means shared amenities, open spaces and community infrastructure are distributed across the layout rather than compressed into a single corner, which directly affects how accessible and usable the facilities are for residents on a day-to-day basis.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
          </div>
      </section>


