  <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization","name":"Square Yards","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#logo","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/assets/images/squareyards-logo-new.png","contentUrl":"https://www.squareyards.com/assets/images/squareyards-logo-new.png","caption":"Square Yards"},"image":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#logo"},"address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"M3M Urbana Business Park, 1st Floor, Tower A, Sector 67","addressLocality":"Gurgaon","addressRegion":"Haryana","postalCode":"122102","addressCountry":"IN"},"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"connect@squareyards.com","availableLanguage":"en"}],"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/SquareYards","https://www.linkedin.com/company/square-yards","https://www.youtube.com/@Square_Yards","https://www.instagram.com/square_yards/"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#website","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/","name":"Square Yards","publisher":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization"},"inLanguage":"en-IN"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/arvind-projects/426/builder#organization","name":"Arvind","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/arvind-projects/426/builder","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/arvind-426-4561.jpg","contentUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/arvind-426-4561.jpg","caption":"Arvind developer logo"},"description":"Arvind is one of India&rsquo;s biggest business houses, having been founded in 1931. It has always been famous for being the country&rsquo;s foremost manufacturer of super-fine fabrics. It is one of the world&rsquo;s biggest denim makers while it has also earned global recognition in categories like shirting, knitted fabrics and khaki. It also has a significant presence in the readymade garment market including shirts, knits, jeans and so on. It also holds India&rsquo;s largest portfolio of apparel brands along with the most comprehensive value retail chain for the same. Other business interests include advanced textiles, fire protection fabric, engineering, telecom and real estate. Arvind Infrastructure was found in 2009 with a view towards productively unlocking the gargantuan land banks owned by the organization in Gujarat. It aims at offering high quality real estate solutions which add greater value through pioneering designs, premium amenities and top notch customer service. There are plans for several mega offerings in both Ahmedabad and Bangalore across both residential and commercial segments. As listed on Square Yards, Arvind has 25 total projects, of which 20 are delivered."},{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/arvind-sylva-mullur-bangalore-npd-344456#primaryimage","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/bangalore/project-image/arvind-sylva-project-project-large-image1-8577-opt-8ac53cba-c126-4fb7-bb14-84730d2ccf64.jpg","contentUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/bangalore/project-image/arvind-sylva-project-project-large-image1-8577-opt-8ac53cba-c126-4fb7-bb14-84730d2ccf64.jpg","caption":"Cover image of Arvind Sylva, Mullur, Bangalore"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/arvind-sylva-mullur-bangalore-npd-344456#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.squareyards.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"New Projects in Bangalore","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/new-projects-in-bangalore"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Projects in Mullur","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/projects-in-mullur-bangalore"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Arvind Sylva","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/arvind-sylva-mullur-bangalore-npd-